     1005       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
     1006            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE .
     1007   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1008        loc-doc-rcv.base-scale AT ROW 7 COL 27.63 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
     1009              VIEW-AS TEXT
